Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With supplies being limited,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll need to add a rule allowing\Npassage in and out of the colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't afford to let players like\NDhruv, who attack people indiscriminately,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave the barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should wait until the players like him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are eliminated from the\Nother colonies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Communication between colonies is a must.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.56,0:00:33.22,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1376,1200)\pos(540,36)}1: Transfer Points
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.56,0:00:33.22,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1376,1200)\pos(393,50)}2: Escape From\Nthe Culling Game
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.56,0:00:33.22,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1376,1200)\pos(243,50)}3: Passage In and\NOut of Colonies
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.56,0:00:33.22,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1376,1200)\pos(90,50)}4: Communication In \Nand Out of Colonies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the two rules Fushiguro proposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a means of communication and\Npassage in and out of the colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll need four additional rules\Nto get the situation under control?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's still at their physical\Nand emotional limit from Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo, I won't let you kill\Nyour best friend twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill Kenjaku myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get the 400 points on my own.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.90,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HE1008E&\3c&H000000&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:00:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can all come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should continue making our\Nway north to the edge of the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you carry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we take a quick rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stadium was being controlled\Nby the sorcerer I just defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any player that comes along\Nwill be pretty hesitant to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.02,0:01:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, get into the stadium. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are these cockroaches real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rika, knock it down! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane, is that a player?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is a player called Kuro Arushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So some players are cursed spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.49,0:02:24.49,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 59\N{\fs30}Sendai Colony
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.71,0:02:29.71,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,305)\bord0\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\1a&H22&}Festering Life Sword
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Likely, it's the other two\Nplayers with high points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you interfere?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuro Urushi is a cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can exercise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to drive positive energy from\Nmy reverse curse technique into its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can ask you the same question, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I like the taste of iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want those other two players to\Nknow I can use reverse curse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rika is protecting\Neveryone in the stadium,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I have to exorcise Kurourushi without\Nusing Rika or my reverse curse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blinding! Blinding! Blinding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Ah! Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Amai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have gained five points for a kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse Cursed Technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? A strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arm is back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her technique probably manipulates space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess she can't use that\Nspace to crush her opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to create distortions\Nlike a funhouse mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wondering about my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It treats the sky as a surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's revealing her technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and attack already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not someone who's going to\Ncomplain about getting killed, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean I can understand powerless\Npeople getting desperate for points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a strong person like you can\Nclaim points whenever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your reason for\Nactively seeking a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little brat seriously are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modern day sorcerers that\Ncasual about incarnation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To us from the old school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means coming back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who lived out their lives without\Nregrets wouldn't accept Kenjaku's offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.94,0:06:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like to think of the culling game as the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first step toward a\Nchance at a second life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind that Kenjaku\Nset the stage for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to earn points to prepare ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if someone like you\Nhas any friends or lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until recently, I didn't\Nhave any friends either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feeling, it's like he's\Nhunting for things that trigger me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pain was caused\Nthousands of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people alive today have\Nnothing to do with your regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many have to die until\Nyou finally feel avenged?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:06:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you one of the Fujiwara?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can anyone from your\Nbloodline understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granite blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ishigori?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came from that rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with Rika protecting the stadium, a\Ndirect hit from an attack on that level?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will leave several people dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I have to take Ishigori out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Code Urushi and Dhruv are gone,\NI have no reason to let Ishigori run free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take both him and Okkotsu out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brennan Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's where Okkotsu\Ndug a hole earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you fight without blowing\Nup everything around you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but that won't satisfy\Nmy hunger, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.15,0:08:28.94,Eyecatch_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1625,0)\3c&HB7C4C2&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you tell a starving\Nkid with a feast in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,front of him to take\Nhis time and eat slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most probably would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a bad example.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first run at life was in\Ncompletely lacking flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of the guys I\Nfought had real backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even met a nice woman, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, it'd be hard to say\NI had any regrets at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This vague hunger I constantly feel\Nis always gnawing at me, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's always wondering\Nwhat I'm so unsatisfied about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These cigarettes have a\Nslightly sweet aftertaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no dessert in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I unsatisfied I think you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm unsatisfied because I'm not fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not calling you a Shikigami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not with you going wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably trying to\Nlimit where I can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, Okkotsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep on coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So precise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I overheated my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good, Okkotsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you be the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you my dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best I've seen so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I strike isn't the person,\Nbut the surface of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thin icebreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost, you pile of vomit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, dick cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's resilient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to torment you some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I've been\Nforced to eat my old technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse Cursed Technique\Nis a pain to deal with,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it burns Cursed Energy like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally seeing the bottom\Nof your reserves, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how high end the sweet shop is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seeing the displays empty at closing\Ntime is always disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to gain more distance\Nfrom everyone in the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep them out of harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.18,0:13:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to me, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has Shikigami completely manifested?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.48,0:13:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any swelling with cursed energy again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which would you like, Rika?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rika is the stockpile of Cursed Energy and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the externalization of Okotsu's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It remained with him after\NRika Orimoto passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While connected to Rika through\Nthe ring, he gains the following.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use of his Cursed Technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the complete manifestation of Rika,\Nand the Cursed Energy supplied by Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:14:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuta can remain connected\Nto Rika for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.03,0:14:15.45,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs30\b1\c&HCECECE&\shad0}Don't Move
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake eyes and fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are super sweet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rage! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get rid of me that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hurt Yaga!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with this, I can't fully block it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finn, icebreaker!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.79,0:16:27.79,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\b1}The Sun, Moon, and Stars Squad was\Nthe Fujiwara Clan's personal squad of assassins.\NWe lived in darkness and served with selfless devotion.\NWe were even forbidden from having our own names.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.88,0:16:31.88,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\b1}Yet that man once granted me a name.\NSo he could execute me instead\Nfor his crime of slaying his own kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiwara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've still got a strong appetite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep chowing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always you, Fujiwara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always getting in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.66,0:16:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you that afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid of me becoming my own person?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okotsu defeated Drew Vlaktawala,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whose technique made the path of\Nhis Shikigami into his domain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which cut into anything it touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Dhruv's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean Bakotsu's\Ntechnique is copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what my ancestors did to\Nyou, but that has nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you live only for your own sake, you're\Neventually going to reach your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live for the sake of others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'll eventually reach my limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop barking those things at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy for you to say\Nyou've already become someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your whining,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because at this point,\Nwords are meaningless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave expansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Future, give me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it tries to\Npenetrate the barrier later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna drag this out,\Nlet's settle this nice and sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment, the black\Ndevil of the modern age...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, I like the taste of iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...flew into the barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.66,0:18:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kurourushi had completed\NParthenogenesis before going dormant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Kurourushi was still alive\Nand well as a cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The complex forces of their domains had\Nbeen keeping the three sorcerers in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this intruder was unexpected,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so the barriers collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Kuro Orushi still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I can't use my technique\Nright after domain expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you take my arm? Fujiwara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, Uro. Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and the roach were\Nnever invited to my table.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granite blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:20:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ishigori's technique is\Ncursed energy discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an extremely simple attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it performs just as well, even\Nwhen his technique is burnt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my table, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rika, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okkotsu can discharge a high\Nvolume of cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but only while Rika is\Ncompletely manifested. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his maximum output is slightly\Ninferior to Ishigori's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he planned to charge\Nand unleash his Cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Energy before Ishigori\Nreached maximum output.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he changed his mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.35,0:21:00.94,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,3425)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs30\bord0\shad0}Let's let it all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,400 years of longing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The intense gaze full of that hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Melted Yuta Okotsu's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he would likely\Nnever find meaning In fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was some seriously\Nsweet stuff for Okkotsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, atta boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep this dinner party going!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:22:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That big thing can fire on its\Nown, but its force is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.88,0:22:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After domain expansion and a meal with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even you haven't had enough time to\Ndigest and recover your full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll end this. Granite Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Okotsu's technique
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had already recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using Uro's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was more than\Njust a cursed speech user.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I figured that big thing probably had\Na different technique from Okotsu's too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okotsu's technique is copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.08,0:22:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there should be\Nstrenuous conditions on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.42,0:22:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he satisfy those conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I wasn't looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there aren't any!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was when he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an icebreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.28,0:23:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okotsu's connection to Rika was seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.48,0:23:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.98,0:23:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still more after going all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it's like to eat dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.57,0:24:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.76,0:24:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that my technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.04,0:24:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sent it sailing back to\Nme using Hugo's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.42,0:24:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Todo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.00,0:24:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.14,0:25:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okkotsu, you're too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.30,0:25:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparing the life of a sorcerer\Nwho fought to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to gain from killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.08,0:25:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uro told me the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.14,0:25:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that woman's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.96,0:25:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess my blast was\Nweaker after my domain expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was it she kept going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.44,0:25:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you having a lover spat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.28,0:25:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.60,0:25:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, don't let her get to ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can say to that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything I do say will lead to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, it's because I'm blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.28,0:25:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because frankly, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.34,0:25:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, regardless, can I\Nhave your points? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.92,0:26:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.40,0:26:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we didn't give you our points,\Nyou would have killed us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.02,0:26:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.64,0:26:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is you should\Nbe grateful to my friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:17.60,0:26:20.84,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\pos(320,200)}Through the transfer of Ryu Ishigori\Nand Takako Uro's points,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:21.10,0:26:23.64,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(320,200)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20}Yuta Okkotsu came to possess 190 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.30,0:26:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's\Ngoing to reach your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.74,0:26:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.14,0:26:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be it sorcerer or cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All are driven over the\Nedge by the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.62,0:26:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overwhelming aggression that\Nblinds them to everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.68,0:26:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a calamity.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:56.88,0:26:59.89,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\pos(585,300)\an3}To Be Continued
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.14,0:27:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm broken and broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.68,0:27:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of it.\NI'm not afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:28:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.34,0:28:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of it.

